<title>UK: OGC gets approach from Halliburton.</title>
<headline>OGC gets approach from Halliburton.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil and gas services firm OGC International Plc said on Monday it had received an approach from U.S. group Halliburton Co that might lead to an offer for OGC.</p>
</text>
